		{"id":"n-comment","type":"text","text":"GENERATED AT ENTRY — this machine's states are the OPEN iterations, each standing as its KICKOFF (the rest of an iteration's machine is seeded by the kickoff's outcome; that lane is the next build). Seeding is a function (se_seed_iteration: goal + vision + inputs) — a seeded iteration stands here at once. A pending 'needs retro' note gates only the FIRST start of a never-walked iteration. With nothing open, start runs to end. This drawing is the stub that carries the frontmatter.","x":-1100,"y":-340,"width":900,"height":180},
